OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be partly cloudy with a few
OL,7,Fshowers. The rest of the night will
OL,8,Fsee clear periods with a few showers
OL,9,Fin the west, drier elsewhere.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FSome sunny intervals and
OL,12,Fscattered showers in the morning,
OL,13,Fthese mainly in the west. Becoming
OL,14,Flargely dry in the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMostly
OL,17,Fdry and increasingly windy on Tuesday
OL,18,Fwith strong southeasterly winds. Early
OL,19,Fwind and rain on Wednesday followed by
OL,20,Fa few showers. Bright with a few
OL,21,Fshowers on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
